---
import CourseLayout from "../../layouts/CourseLayout.astro";
---
<CourseLayout title="Activate your access" eyebrow="The Weekend Ecosystem™ · Buyers only">
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;max-width:58ch;margin:0 0 10px">Thank you for buying. Type the email address you purchased with, press the button, and your access opens right away.</p>
<p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;max-width:58ch;margin:0 0 28px;color:rgba(43,22,27,.62)">Use the same address you checked out with. Once you see the confirmation, open the course and enter that email to unlock it.</p>
<div class="ml-embedded" data-form="cWNRvo"></div>
<p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;margin:28px 0 0"><a href="/weekend-ecosystem" style="color:#D62E73">Open the course</a></p>
<p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:18px 0 0;color:rgba(43,22,27,.6)">Stuck? Email <a href="mailto:hello@thedigitalincomeedit.com" style="color:#D62E73">hello@thedigitalincomeedit.com</a> and I will sort it.</p>
</CourseLayout>
<script is:inline src="https://assets.mailerlite.com/js/universal.js" async></script>
<script is:inline>
window.ml = window.ml || function () { (window.ml.q = window.ml.q || []).push(arguments); };
ml("account", "2532349");
</script>
